# apps/web/.local.env — local secrets only (gitignored).
# Same file structure applies to .dev.env / .prod.env (synced to GitHub Secrets
# via `pnpm sync:secrets`). See docs/environment.md.
#
# Topology (custom domains, project name) lives in config.ts at the repo root,
# NOT in env files. NEXT_PUBLIC_SERVER_URL is auto-derived in alchemy.run.ts.
#
# Currently no app-specific env vars are required for the web app. Add
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* keys here (analytics, etc.) — they get inlined into the
# client bundle at build time, so never put secrets behind that prefix.
